        <main className="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-14">
          <h1 className="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Blog</h1>
          <p className="mt-3 text-slate-600">Definitional and how-to posts that help search engines and humans understand ReturnCopy.</p>
          <div className="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <article className="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 className="font-semibold text-slate-900">What is ReturnCopy — and when to use it</h3>
            <p className="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">ReturnCopy generates a clear, on-brand return and refund policy plus empathetic customer-facing replies for common return reasons. It is for store owners who want fair, consistent return copy. Use it when you need a return policy and replies that keep customer trust.</p>
          </article>
          <article className="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
